sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.3
    participant PreProc as payload-pre-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant PostProc as payload-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Provider as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TenantR as Tenant Reconciler
    participant ModelR as ExternalModel Reconciler

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over TenantR,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Tenant Praxis Installation
        K8sAPI->>TenantR: MaasTenantConfig watch event<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        TenantR->>K8sAPI: GET AITenant (read gatewayRef)<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
        TenantR->>TenantR: Kustomize build (local manifests)
        TenantR->>K8sAPI: SSA apply: Deployments, Services,<br/>EnvoyFilters, DestinationRules, RBAC<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over ModelR,K8sAPI: Flow 2: ExternalModel Reconciliation
        K8sAPI->>ModelR: ExternalModel watch event<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount
        ModelR->>K8sAPI: List ExternalProviders<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
        ModelR->>K8sAPI: GET Secret via APIReader<br/>(bypass cache)<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
        ModelR->>K8sAPI: SSA apply: Service, ServiceEntry,<br/>DestinationRule, HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
        ModelR->>K8sAPI: SSA apply: routing overlay ConfigMap<br/>(SHA-256 content-addressed)<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Provider: Flow 3: Inference Request (runtime)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.3 / Kuadrant auth
        Gateway->>PreProc: ExtProc pre-auth processing<br/>gRPC/HTTP2 9004/TCP<br/>TLS (ACCEPT_UNTRUSTED)
        PreProc-->>Gateway: Pre-auth response
        Note over Gateway: Kuadrant WasmPlugin auth
        Gateway->>PostProc: ExtProc post-auth processing<br/>gRPC/HTTP2 9004/TCP<br/>TLS (ACCEPT_UNTRUSTED)
        PostProc-->>Gateway: Post-auth response<br/>(API key injection, routing)
        Gateway->>Provider: Forward to LLM provider<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP TLS SIMPLE<br/>API key (injected by ExtProc)
        Provider-->>Gateway: LLM response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON response
    end
